<title>USA: Successories sells line through Wal-Mart.</title>
<headline>Successories sells line through Wal-Mart.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Ill. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Successories Inc said Tuesday it has begun shipping its Winners line of pens, paper, framed posters and other proprietary products to Wal-Mart Stores Inc to be sold through 1,500 of the retailer's stores.</p>
<p>The company said it began shipping the line during the second quarter.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
